      "kind": "fenced_code",
      "start_line": 73,
      "end_line": 82,
      "raw": "```qml\nimport LVRS 1.0 as LV\n\nLV.IconSegmentedControl {\n    methods: [function(eventData) { syncToolbarState() }]\n\n    LV.IconButton { iconName: \"projectStructure\" }\n    LV.IconButton { iconName: \"projectStructure\" }\n}\n```\n",
